core             Script:  initial


Test dual-stack WireGuard tunnels. The tested device has a WireGuard
tunnel carrying both IPv4 and IPv6 and runs OSPFv2 and OSPFv3 over it. The
probe should receive the routes advertised from the tested device and be
able to ping its loopback over both address families.

